MN1 (B B VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=6 w=60 nf=1 m=1 ad=18 as=18 pd=120.6 ps=120.6
MN2 (A B S VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=6 w=720 nf=1 m=1 ad=216 as=216 pd=1440.6 ps=1440.6
MN3 (X X VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=8 w=0.42 nf=1 m=1 ad=0.126 as=0.126 pd=1.44 ps=1.44
