MN5 (A SU VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=8 w=0.42 nf=1 m=1 ad=0.126 as=0.126 pd=1.44 ps=1.44
MP1 (B A VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=224 nf=1 m=1 ad=67.2 as=67.2 pd=448.6 ps=448.6
MP2 (A A VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=224 nf=1 m=1 ad=67.2 as=67.2 pd=448.6 ps=448.6
MP3 (X A VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=672 nf=1 m=1 ad=201.6 as=201.6 pd=1344.6 ps=1344.6
RSTART (SU VSS) resistor r=50M
